{"id":"649002","name":"沙茶牛肉粿","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/649002/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"潮汕粿条","amount":"适量"},{"name":"牛肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"香芹","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛肉洗净切薄片，加入适量玉米淀粉抓匀。","img":"images/649002/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入适量生抽，蚝油抓匀。","img":"images/649002/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"再加入适量花生油抓匀静置。","img":"images/649002/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"香芹洗净切细备用。","img":"images/649002/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"沙茶酱舀入碗中。","img":"images/649002/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量开水调匀。","img":"images/649002/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"适量花生芝麻酱同样用开水调匀。","img":"images/649002/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"锅中水烧开，加入少许盐和花生油。","img":"images/649002/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入粿条煮开后捞出。","img":"images/649002/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入牛肉焯烫。","img":"images/649002/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"焯烫至变色盛入盘中。","img":"images/649002/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"淋上花生芝麻酱和沙茶酱，洒上香芹粒即可。","img":"images/649002/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/649002/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/649002/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/649002/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/649002/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}